msgctxt "1640\tEXPLANATION"
msgid ""
"Waiter at Café Alps.\n"
"-Was in relationship with waitress Usami.\n"
"-Passed locker room while closing store to\n"
"witness Usami cheating with store manager Oda.\n"
"-Beat Oda to death with an ashtray (?)\n"
"-Witnessed fleeing scene by Kinoshita.\n"
"-Own fingerprints found on murder weapon.\n"
"-Convicted of murder. Now serving sentence."
msgstr ""

